#!/bin/bash
# Tanda de referencias del ciclo 28: los siete habitantes del Arco I, de a dos en paralelo.
cd "$(dirname "$0")"
R=./referencias.sh
$R lumen "Lumen, an old master electrician and inventor, short and stout: wild fluffy white hair and a big bushy white beard and moustache, brass goggles with teal lenses pushed up on his forehead, a plum-purple shirt with rolled sleeves, a thick brown leather work apron with pockets full of tools (pliers, screwdrivers, a wrench), dark grey trousers, brown leather boots." &
$R marin "Marin, the plump friendly baker of the village: curly brown shoulder-length hair, a short beard and moustache, a warm smile, a cream shirt with rolled sleeves, a mustard-ochre vest with buttons, a long cream baker's apron with a few flour stains, a small leather pouch at the belt, olive trousers, brown boots." &
wait
$R vega "Vega, a calm woman who keeps the spring's waterworks: long silver-grey hair in one thick braid over the shoulder, warm brown eyes, a sage-green long-sleeved dress with cream cuffs, a teal-blue apron skirt over it, a brown leather belt with two small brass canisters, brown boots." &
$R nereo "Nereo, the old lighthouse keeper: a navy-blue knitted beanie with a small brass button, a white beard, a long mustard-yellow scarf, a cream heavy wool pea coat with brass buttons, a brown leather satchel on a strap, navy trousers, brown boots." &
wait
$R tala "Tala, a lively village girl of about 12: long wavy dark-brown hair loosely tied back, brown eyes, a mustard-yellow tunic, a dark teal vest with brass buttons, a small brown satchel and belt pouches, dark teal trousers tucked into brown boots." &
$R yesca "Yesca, the young blacksmith of the terraces, sturdy and cheerful: a big bright copper-orange ponytail, freckles, brass goggles with teal lenses on her forehead, an orange shirt with rolled sleeves, a dark leather work apron with crossed straps over a khaki skirt-apron, dark trousers, brown boots." &
wait
$R consejera "Ivara, the councillor of the castle, a dignified young woman with warm brown skin: black hair in an elaborate braided bun, small gold earrings, a deep purple cape with gold embroidered borders fastened at the neck, a cream blouse, a long navy-blue robe with gold trim, a brown leather book held at her side, brown boots." &
wait
echo tanda lista
